WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,730 --> 00:00:05,930
I'll go to the front to wait for guests first

2
00:00:05,930 --> 00:00:09,880
Your legs and feet are inconvenient. Drink less wine.

3
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:12,200
Will you be back soon?

4
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:17,540
Then I'll wait for you to come back

5
00:00:23,530 --> 00:00:24,490
Is Hough back?

6
00:00:25,140 --> 00:00:26,180
Waiting for you in the study

7
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:32,520
What's going on in the front yard?

8
00:00:32,920 --> 00:00:34,600
The palace sent three congratulatory gifts

9
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:35,760
Except for His Majesty's

10
00:00:35,760 --> 00:00:37,600
The prince and concubine also sent people to deliver gifts

11
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:38,560
last life

12
00:00:38,760 --> 00:00:40,680
I expelled the palace and paved the way for the prince

13
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:41,960
Changed to a glass of poisonous wine

14
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:43,200
A new life

15
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:46,280
Don't give me another chance to make the same mistakes again

16
00:00:46,520 --> 00:00:49,560
Why don't you give back the two cents you gave me after the gift?

17
00:00:49,760 --> 00:00:55,040
Tonight, the prince will rest in the study and return to his room to play chess with Chuntao.
